  hyper.zone.width = 1 - P, the share of the beta scale in which a
  sample counts as hyper-methylated. hypo.zone.width = N - 0.
  P.bracket.width = how far apart the two samples straddling the
  threshold sit. Where that is smaller than array noise, the call
  is not reproducible - Part C measures exactly that.
